# wobble_bench.scn — wobble-minimization benchmark: POS_HOLD hover under turbulence
#                    ふらつき最小化ベンチマーク: 乱流下の POS_HOLD ホバー  (experiment/wobble-min)
#
# Run with: sf sils scenario simulator/sils/scenarios/wobble_bench.scn --target vehicle \
#           --turbulence 0.03 --noise n2 --seed 7 --duration 30000000
#
# The position loop fights the 1-3 Hz turbulence force → commands tilt → the attitude/rate
# loops wobble. Measure gyro_rms / att_rms / duty_rms in the steady hover window [12,28] s.
# Compare control methods (M0 baseline → M1…) under the SAME turbulence+noise+seed.
# 位置ループが1-3Hz乱流に抗して傾きを指令→姿勢/レートがふらつく。定常ホバー窓[12,28]sで
# gyro_rms/att_rms/duty_rmsを測り、同一乱流+ノイズ+シードで各手法を比較。
#
#  <t>  ch  <thr> <roll> <pitch> <yaw> <arm> <hold_ms> <rate_hz> <alt> <acro> <pos>
   0    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     6000      50                       # A: boot → IDLE
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     1500      50        0     0     1   # B: POS_HOLD switch ON (disarmed)
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  1     1000      50        0     0     1   # C: ARM in POS_HOLD → auto-takeoff
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  1     22000     50        0     0     1   # D: hover 22 s under turbulence (measure wobble)
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     500       50        0     0     1   # E: release ARM button
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  1     4000      50        0     0     1   # F: DISARM → auto-land
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     600       50                       # G: settle
